      "filename": "Atik Mustafa Pasha Mosque 4764.jpg",
      "title": "File:Atik Mustafa Pasha Mosque 4764.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6e/Atik_Mustafa_Pasha_Mosque_4764.jpg",
